Dark cyberpunk wallpaper texture for a phone app background, portrait. An almost black surface of matte carbon fibre and dark anodised metal panels with a very subtle hexagon mesh pattern. Extremely low contrast and very dark overall, so that white text placed on top stays easy to read. A faint electric cyan light leak along the left edge and a faint hot magenta light leak along the right edge, soft and dim. No objects, no buttons, no lines of light across the middle, no text, no logos, no people, no city. Flat, even, front-on, like a material sample.
